        {
          "title": "ContextFocus: Activation Steering for Contextual Faithfulness in Large Language Models",
          "title_zh": "ContextFocus：面向大语言模型上下文忠实度的激活引导",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2601.04131v2",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "research_papers",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2601.04131",
          "summary": "ContextFocus is a lightweight activation-steering method that improves faithfulness to retrieved context when it conflicts with parametric knowledge, without fine-tuning and with minimal inference overhead. On ConFiQA it reports significant gains over baselines including ContextDPO and COIECD, and the authors say it is complementary to prompting strategies and remains effective on larger models.",
