          "title": "KDCM: Reducing Hallucination in LLMs through Explicit Reasoning Structures",
          "title_zh": "KDCM：通过显式推理结构减少大语言模型幻觉",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2601.04086v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "research_papers",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2601.04086",
          "summary": "KDCM extends chain-style knowledge distillation with a programmable module that guides knowledge graph exploration as executable code inside the reasoning prompt. On public benchmarks with GPT-4 and LLaMA-3.3 it reports HIT@1, HIT@3 and HIT@5 gains of 15.64%, 13.38% and 13.28% and reduced prompt-induced hallucination.",
