        {
          "title": "Agentic Rubrics as Contextual Verifiers for SWE Agents",
          "title_zh": "智能体评分细则：面向 SWE 智能体的上下文验证器",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2601.04171v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "research_papers",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2601.04171",
          "summary": "Agentic Rubrics has an expert agent interact with a repository to build a context-grounded checklist, then scores candidate patches against it without executing tests. On SWE-Bench Verified under parallel test-time scaling it reaches 54.2% with Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B and 40.6% with Qwen3-32B, at least 3.5 percentage points above the strongest baseline.",
